<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merix Corp cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merix Corp cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jensen Securities said it reduced its rating on Merix Corp to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- cited worse than expected fundamentals and the resignation of Larry Neitling as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>-- On February 28 Merix forecast a net loss of $0.20 per share on sales of $36 million for the third quarter, ended March 1, below management's original expectations.</p>
<p>-- shares closed at 13-13/16 Monday.</p>
</text>
